LanguageData.GM21_Melee_DodgeTooltip:
Melee dodge chance (vanilla, capped): {0}
Grandmaster effective melee defence: {1}

The Stats tab shows the vanilla value, which is what RimWorld caps every pawn at. A Grandmaster's actual defence is the second figure. Ranged dodge is unaffected - a Melee Grandmaster answers projectiles by intercepting them, not by dodging them.

LanguageData.GM21_Uninstall_DoneBody:
Grandmaster skill cleanup complete.

 - Grandmaster skills reduced to level 20: {0}
 - Skill records with Grandmaster progress cleared: {1}
 - Pawns processed: {2}
 - Medicine 21 state cleared (treatments, modes, interventions in progress): {3}

Magical workstations, catalysts and artifact metadata were not removed by this action. Remove any remaining crafting objects before disabling the mod.

Save the game now, exit RimWorld, then disable Grandmaster 21.

The game has NOT been saved automatically, so you can write to a new save slot if you prefer.
